    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to a world where the government withholds the truth, and every resident is a suspect.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an <strong>investigator</strong>, a state agent assigned to a newly quarantined sector to investigate <strong>cases of infection</strong>. Your task is to analyze evidence, interrogate residents, and make <strong>morally complex decisions</strong> that will determine their fate. But the deeper you delve into the investigation, the more you realize\u2014the real threat isn\u2019t just the virus...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Your Mission:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search apartments, collect evidence, and uncover <strong>hidden details</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze data and <strong>identify the infected</strong> based on solid proof.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conduct interrogations, but beware\u2014<strong>people lie</strong>. Can you spot deception?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make tough choices: <strong>save the innocent or obey orders</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/93bf4c11b5f8320abfd684ef7adc359b.avif?t=1751200270\" data-has-big width=800 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/0b191a06339bd92c8ac68c9284a757a1.poster.avif?t=1751200270\" width=734 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/0b191a06339bd92c8ac68c9284a757a1.webm?t=1751200270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/0b191a06339bd92c8ac68c9284a757a1.mp4?t=1751200270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a strict three-part protocol when identifying infected citizens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/886301a5c991147db2d69325e8b54ea7.avif?t=1751200270\" data-has-big width=800 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/0003e05ac26d7c4abcfd6a07b0c8a6e5.poster.avif?t=1751200270\" width=734 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/0003e05ac26d7c4abcfd6a07b0c8a6e5.webm?t=1751200270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/0003e05ac26d7c4abcfd6a07b0c8a6e5.mp4?t=1751200270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of an underground bunker where humanity hides, fleeing a global catastrophe. Experience the lives of its people as you investigate local stories and deliver verdicts that decide their fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/bcb0dd818ff9640bc9162c1298551af8.avif?t=1751200270\" width=788 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/21c77482ca7eaf4a883a0921ee593552.poster.avif?t=1751200270\" width=734 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/21c77482ca7eaf4a883a0921ee593552.webm?t=1751200270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/21c77482ca7eaf4a883a0921ee593552.mp4?t=1751200270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fatum</strong> presents a true challenge, stripping you of familiar hints. You must rely on your intuition, piecing together visual and social clues into a coherent narrative. You will never be certain if you\u2019re making the right choice</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/df60d8a84a361cc43a28b8f82f637d90.avif?t=1751200270\" data-has-big width=800 height=81 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be cautious in your decisions\u2014every choice has consequences. Only you can decide your approach to each subject: an aggressive interrogation tactic or helping them with daily struggles to uncover information about someone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to a world where the government withholds the truth, and every resident is a suspect.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an <strong>investigator</strong>, a state agent assigned to a newly quarantined sector to investigate <strong>cases of infection</strong>. Your task is to analyze evidence, interrogate residents, and make <strong>morally complex decisions</strong> that will determine their fate. But the deeper you delve into the investigation, the more you realize\u2014the real threat isn\u2019t just the virus...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Your Mission:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search apartments, collect evidence, and uncover <strong>hidden details</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze data and <strong>identify the infected</strong> based on solid proof.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conduct interrogations, but beware\u2014<strong>people lie</strong>. Can you spot deception?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make tough choices: <strong>save the innocent or obey orders</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/93bf4c11b5f8320abfd684ef7adc359b.avif?t=1751200270\" data-has-big width=800 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/0b191a06339bd92c8ac68c9284a757a1.poster.avif?t=1751200270\" width=734 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/0b191a06339bd92c8ac68c9284a757a1.webm?t=1751200270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/0b191a06339bd92c8ac68c9284a757a1.mp4?t=1751200270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a strict three-part protocol when identifying infected citizens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/886301a5c991147db2d69325e8b54ea7.avif?t=1751200270\" data-has-big width=800 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/0003e05ac26d7c4abcfd6a07b0c8a6e5.poster.avif?t=1751200270\" width=734 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/0003e05ac26d7c4abcfd6a07b0c8a6e5.webm?t=1751200270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/0003e05ac26d7c4abcfd6a07b0c8a6e5.mp4?t=1751200270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of an underground bunker where humanity hides, fleeing a global catastrophe. Experience the lives of its people as you investigate local stories and deliver verdicts that decide their fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/bcb0dd818ff9640bc9162c1298551af8.avif?t=1751200270\" width=788 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/21c77482ca7eaf4a883a0921ee593552.poster.avif?t=1751200270\" width=734 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/21c77482ca7eaf4a883a0921ee593552.webm?t=1751200270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/21c77482ca7eaf4a883a0921ee593552.mp4?t=1751200270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fatum</strong> presents a true challenge, stripping you of familiar hints. You must rely on your intuition, piecing together visual and social clues into a coherent narrative. You will never be certain if you\u2019re making the right choice</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568740/extras/df60d8a84a361cc43a28b8f82f637d90.avif?t=1751200270\" data-has-big width=800 height=81 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be cautious in your decisions\u2014every choice has consequences. Only you can decide your approach to each subject: an aggressive interrogation tactic or helping them with daily struggles to uncover information about someone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "This situation is temporary, but it comes with a strict protocol that you must follow. Morality and cold calculation intertwine in a dark tale. You are an investigator, and your arrival marks a turning point in the lives of those you encounter.",
